        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voidnomaly will take you to a mansion invaded by energy from another dimension, which you will have to inspect to determine what is an anomaly, and what is not. Also, if you like to explore, you may end up in different places outside the mansion... but you will probably not like what you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an important job, and you have to complete your quota before your shift ends. No one likes lazy workers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voidnomaly is a first person horror game (Depending on the fear level selected), which focuses into the search of discrepancies in the rooms of the mansion where you have been hired. In this game, you can adjust the difficulty and fear level, in case you just want to enjoy the search of anomalies without being bothered a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face creatures that want to play with you, with events that make no sense, and you will have to do it alone. Will you survive 4 days and receive your reward, or will you quit before finishing?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voidnomaly will take you to a mansion invaded by energy from another dimension, which you will have to inspect to determine what is an anomaly, and what is not. Also, if you like to explore, you may end up in different places outside the mansion... but you will probably not like what you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an important job, and you have to complete your quota before your shift ends. No one likes lazy workers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voidnomaly is a first person horror game (Depending on the fear level selected), which focuses into the search of discrepancies in the rooms of the mansion where you have been hired. In this game, you can adjust the difficulty and fear level, in case you just want to enjoy the search of anomalies without being bothered a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face creatures that want to play with you, with events that make no sense, and you will have to do it alone. Will you survive 4 days and receive your reward, or will you quit before finishing?</p>",
        "short_description": "You finally got a good job, with an incredible pay for just 4 days of work. Get into the mansion, find the anomalies, complete your daily quota, and leave. The company said there isn't any life or death risk, but you may face &quot;weird&quot; things. It doesn't sound too dangerous. Easy-peasy.... right?",
        "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain",
